--   Chapter 19 definition: $k$-section of a power series at residue $r$
-- statement:
--   This bundle defines the $k$-section at residue $r$ of a power series $\varphi=\sum a_nX^n$ over a commutative semiring as the series $\sum_n a_{kn+r}X^n$, that is, the subsequence at the literal indices $kn+r$. For $k>0$ and $r<k$, this is the full compressed residue-$r$ subsequence. It is the foundation for the mod-5 and general Ramanujan-congruence arguments.
